   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Maui Resilience Project- Thriving and Coping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Offering yoga, meditation, tai chi and other mindfulness resources as well as Reiki, Healing Touch and hands on Trauma Therapy and exercises. These will be free offerings both online and in person on the island of Maui. The trauma and grief are very large and giving tools to be able to process and release the horror of the Wild Fire Tragedy with empower them to thrive and function.</narrative>
